data.value:
Creates an access token using the API token. The access token is short-lived (30 minutes) and should be used in the Authorization header.
Example request:
POST /api/auth/token
{ "apiToken": "existing-api-token-here" }
Example response:
{ "accessToken": "new-guid", "accessTokenExpiry": "2025-01-27T12:00:00Z", "refreshToken": "some-refresh-token", "refreshTokenExpiry": "2025-02-03T12:00:00Z", "userId": "user-guid", "lastUpdate": "2025-01-27T11:30:00Z" }

Stores an air quality measurement for the authenticated user.
Requires Bearer token obtained from /auth/token.
Example request:
POST /api/measurement Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
{ "co": 0.4, "no2": 0.02, "pm25": 12.5, "pm10": 25.0, "latitude": 55.751244, "longitude": 37.618423 }
